/*******************************
    User Variable Overrides
*******************************/

// less 3+ no longer evaluates operations inside calc(), so the default definition writes the negated (already
// negative) margin as "--0.05rem", which is invalid. Negate it outside of calc(), like less 2 did.
@ribbonImageNegatedMargin: -@ribbonImageMargin;
@ribbonImageOffset: calc(@ribbonImageNegatedMargin - @ribbonTriangleSize);
